OL,3,GNEWSA'Fear won't protect you from
OL,4,Abreast cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has described the shock of
OL,7,Ffinding out she had breast cancer
OL,8,Fdespite feeling she was in the prime of
OL,9,Fhealth.
OL,11,FProf Linda Flores, from the University
OL,12,Fof Oxford, was diagnosed at the age of
OL,13,F52 in 2024 after a mammogram.
OL,15,FShe said: "If I had gone with my
OL,16,Finstincts that said I was remarkably
OL,17,Fhealthy... then I might not be sitting
OL,18,Fin this chair today."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
