OL,3,GNEWSA'Fear won't protect you from
OL,4,Abreast cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlores, who has no family history of
OL,7,Fcancer, said her advice to women
OL,8,Fconsidering a mammogram was: "Fear
OL,9,Fwon't protect you."
